 "remarks": "Privately nestled in Westport's coveted Old Hill neighborhood, this distinctive five-bedroom New England residence blends timeless character with thoughtful modern updates. Sun-filled interiors, beautifully scaled rooms, and original architectural details create warmth and authenticity throughout. The chef's kitchen is designed for both everyday living and entertaining, while the stunning, light-filled family room with fireplace offers a welcoming gathering space overlooking the beautifully landscaped grounds. A true standout is the inviting pub room with its original wood bar - an exceptional setting for entertaining, celebrations, or relaxed evenings at home. The versatile third level offers endless possibilities as a private guest retreat, second primary suite, home office or gym. Outside, mature specimen trees, flowering gardens, rolling lawns, and elegant stone terraces create a private retreat that evolves beautifully with the seasons. A charming barn with electricity, water, cable, and convenient parking adds exceptional flexibility as a studio, workshop, recreation space, or future vision. Just minutes from downtown Westport, award-winning schools, beaches, shopping, dining, and the train, 4 Crawford Road offers a rare opportunity to own a home with genuine character, exceptional privacy, and a wonderful sense of place. A truly special Westport residence that brings together character, comfort, and an exceptional setting.",
